      -    POINTER VALUE NULL.
       05 CBLC-TPL-VECTOR-INT-CTOR-SOURCE-RELOCATION USAGE 
      -    POINTER VALUE NULL.
       05 CBLC-TPL-VECTOR-INT-CTOR-SOURCE-COUNT PIC S9(9).
       05 CBLC-TPL-VECTOR-INT-CTOR-SOURCE-RESERVED PIC S9(9).
